</i>to enter Kuruth, but I'm wont to use my character's true strengths, which is not combat, per se.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T18:57:23-07:00","id":533881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/525133-lfg-werewolf-the-forsaken-2ed?p=533856#post533856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Mochigami would make sense, as mochi are considered a symbol of teamwork and community. Also would be a good source of the Gift of Shaping.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not familiar with that term.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T19:55:03-07:00","id":533940,"title":"","content":"Can't say I am either, given our characters and this being the pacific northwest I think an even better fitting elemental would be mist or fog (mist just sounds cooler) the spirit could also come to stand for more as time goes on and we invest of course.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T20:21:40-07:00","id":533952,"title":"","content":"I'd be cool with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T22:36:40-07:00","id":534045,"title":"","content":"I got most of Will's backstory added to his sheet, but here's the full writeup. I put more detail into his First Change, though. <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Will grew up in the suburbs of Willapa.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">His father disappeared shortly after his birth.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">His mother was involved in Neo-Paganism and Popular Taoism</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">He could channel spirits from a young age, which always was a cause of discomfort.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">He had a bout of Alcoholism in his late teens.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">After losing a friend to a drug overdose, he sobered up, went to community college, but stagnated a bit due to the voices</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Trying to turn adversity into profit, he got into the Telephone Psychic business, which he excelled at until his &quot;Accident.&quot;</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">On the night of his &quot;Accident,&quot; his apartment was destroyed by a swarm of Little Deaths. They were upset at him, but he couldn't tell why. Angered at the destruction they were reaping, his will broke, he shifted into the Near-Wolf form, and then he understood. They were mad because he wasn't listening, that he was giving bad information to his callers and their meals were being soured by hope. He devoured a few but they were endless. They chased him into the night until he collapsed from exhaustion.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">When he next woke, he was at his mother's home, some 20 miles from his apartment. She told him everything that happened to him, then gave him a lift back to his home, now a rotten, moldering wreck.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Over the next few months, she trained him, redressing the half truths and monkey-shines he grew up with, teaching him the secrets of their Tribe. And then she vanished again. She said that she had to move on, that she was needed elsewhere, that the &quot;prey&quot; had moved on. She left a few notebooks, written in the First Tongue, that had a lot of information on the Shadow, mostly a shopping list of bans and banes, with him, as well as the keys to her house.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">Eventually, he hunted down the deaths he faced before and made a deal-- he vowed to listen, and tell the unvarnished truth where they were concerned, and in exchange, they'd lend him their power.</span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T22:46:28-07:00","id":534061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Okami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/525133-lfg-werewolf-the-forsaken-2ed?p=533940#post533940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can't say I am either, given our characters and this being the pacific northwest I think an even better fitting elemental would be mist or fog (mist just sounds cooler) the spirit could also come to stand for more as time goes on and we invest of course.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok. I'm still thinking in terms of Japanese mythology, but I can work with more local material.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T10:03:13-07:00","id":534559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/525133-lfg-werewolf-the-forsaken-2ed?p=534061#post534061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ok. I'm still thinking in terms of Japanese mythology, but I can work with more local material.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ah, recognized the language but I'm not too familiar with too many of the creatures in its mythology beyond broad categories, there are easily hundreds of supernatural creatures and a kami for everything. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T10:22:52-07:00","id":534576,"title":"","content":"I'm glad I'm not crazy for having thought of Japanese rice cakes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T11:49:28-07:00","id":534652,"title":"","content":"I'd be cool with a mist spirit as totem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T11:55:19-07:00","id":534655,"title":"","content":"Mist would be fine by me, too, although I don't know what ban it would have (or give). Its blessings would probably extend to stealth or the keeping of secrets. That may give an idea for bans.","signa