/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T20:31:49-07:00","id":544707,"title":"","content":"I'm cool with that as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T17:21:56-07:00","id":546141,"title":"","content":"I'm okay with Mist Walkers, or Walkers in the Mist or any combination of Mist, Walking, Shadows, Shrouds, etc.<br /> <br /> It also does make some sense to wait for a totem before a pack names itself, so that checks for me.<br /> <br /> As far as pack members.<br /> <br /> I've got Madeleine, my Elodoth Storm Lord.<br /> Remy St. Croix. Wolfblood Gambler, drunkard, playboy and general trouble magnet.<br /> Tony Two Fingers, Fence. <br /> Moby, Counterfeiter and Forger of documents.<br /> <br /> Hope you guys are okay with all the degenerates and ne'er do wells that Madeleine brings to the group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 06-08-2015, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T17:51:31-07:00","id":546169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amravanti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/525133-lfg-werewolf-the-forsaken-2ed?p=546141#post546141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm okay with Mist Walkers, or Walkers in the Mist or any combination of Mist, Walking, Shadows, Shrouds, etc.<br /> <br /> It also does make some sense to wait for a totem before a pack names itself, so that checks for me.<br /> <br /> As far as pack members.<br /> <br /> I've got Madeleine, my Elodoth Storm Lord.<br /> Remy St. Croix. Wolfblood Gambler/Drunkard.<br /> Tony Two Fingers, Fence.<br /> Moby, Counterfeiter and Forger of documents.<br /> <br /> Hope you guys are okay with all the degenerates and ne'er do wells that Madeleine brings to the group.</div> </div> </div> </div>We all have broken people to add to our Pack, so it should be fine.<br /> <br /> And I stand by the &quot;what&quot; we should call our Pack, but I'm ambivalent as to the &quot;when.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T18:59:29-07:00","id":546299,"title":"","content":"Continuing the roll call, I've got:<br /> Tom, my Irraka Hunter in Darkness<br /> <br /> Rachel, the Wilf-Blooded on the cusp of her First Change, though I figure we'll find out about her during play<br /> <br /> Dolores, a &quot;bag lady&quot; that Tom knew from before his First Change that he continues to look after.<br /> <br /> And Tony, who I forgot to post the new idea for, since Two-Fingers had the &quot;Fence&quot; concept covered. My plan was for his new concept to be &quot;Under-city Squatter&quot;, with 5 dots in &quot;Navigating the under-city&quot;, 4 in &quot;Maneuvering through rubble&quot; and 3 in &quot;assessing structural integrity&quot;, and would also be one of Tom's old acquaintances that he likes to check in on from time to time.<br /> <br /> And yeah, I'm totally cool with nefarious folk in the pack. Tom and the people he cares about also largely live outside the law, though in a somewhat less active way, so I doubt that would stir up much conflict with him, if any.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 06-08-2015, 10:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T00:02:25-07:00","id":546609,"title":"","content":"Looks like the pack is looking at being very underworld oriented (not capital U underworld I mean.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"k