key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T19:22:08-07:00","id":557735,"title":"","content":"Yesssssssssss.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T05:52:42-07:00","id":558138,"title":"","content":"I sent a PM to the others asking if they are still interested in playing, meanwhile shall we start talking about the prelude: the Pack hunt's and binds the Totem?<br /> And also, I'm thinking that you were right, my shitty laptop isn't reliable with all my setting notes, so I'm going to make a Google Doc containing all the setting information I've posted so far, as well as the extra stuff I've salvaged from my most recent tech failure. Mostly stuff about the general attidutes and interests of the Tribes of the Moon In WB.<br /> <br /> As an aside, I've also been thinking, what kind of territory are all you interested in claiming, as a pack? Looking at your various backstories, something with access to the Undercity, an active criminal element, as well as close to the mountains and the Elysian Forest would be alright, as general features? I'm preparing as sort of &quot;Territories in need of Urathas&quot; list, and I'm interested in what kind of environment you were picturing living in as a pack? Or have I misunderstood something, and the pack is hunting the Totem <i>before </i>deciding where to settle down?<br /> <br /> By the way, still waiting for those updated sheets, so far only Charlaquin posted hers. Unless of course you didn't actually change anything.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactio