dquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daydreamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/525133-lfg-werewolf-the-forsaken-2ed?p=558940#post558940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm happy with the way Gideon is except that Parkour still doesn't seem like it fits. And yet, I can't decide how to re-distribute that one dot.</div> </div> </div> </div>You've got a few Merits you could add an extra dot of. Anonymity, Totem, Tactical Shifting, Fleet of Foot... Or you could add something like Fast Reflexes. Moon Kissed is pretty cool. Direction Sense would fit well with your character being a wanderer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T05:26:46-07:00","id":559268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueBiscuit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/525133-lfg-werewolf-the-forsaken-2ed?p=558349#post558349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, third time downloading it, now the page with the backstory and stuff appears properly, but I still can't get stuff like Merits, Gifts or Rites to show up. That's no problem though, I'll just re-write them in manually, it was just the big backstory text that worried me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Get FoxIt Reader for PDFs, works better than say, Acrobat for the editable sheets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T10:20:19-07:00","id":559520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/525133-lfg-werewolf-the-forsaken-2ed?p=559268#post559268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Get FoxIt Reader for PDFs, works better than say, Acrobat for the editable sheets.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the advice, it worked.<br /> <br /> Anyway, given that we're about to start soon-ish, I'll make the OOC thread first, we can finalize any further particulars there, and I'll also post the link to the googledoc where I've started saving (and expanding upon) all the stuff about Willipa Bay and the setting. For now, it's still mostly the stuff you have already read here in this thread, plus an overview of Blood Talons and Bone Shadows in W.B. (more tribes are coming).<br /> <br /> Come on, this game is going to happen.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/559509-ooc-a-forsaken-life-a-wtf-2ed-chronicle\">And here's the link to the OOC thread.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/138-bluebiscuit","name":"BlueBiscuit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"224"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T18:16:45-07:00","id":560076,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B1sYlMEIRzbbMkM5YWRNdVlZM1U&amp;authuser=0\" target=\"_blank\">Updated character sheet.</a> I decided to take another dot of Tactical Shifting. The fourth dot's ability seems appropriate for reasons I'll keep to myself for now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T18:55:53-07:00","id":561472,"title":"","content":"I made a last-minute change to Rachel, swapping a dot of Manipulation for a dot of Composure. Posted the updated version on the OOC thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"ran